# ==============================================================================
# Leonida Watch — Environment Variables (Example)
# ==============================================================================
#
# DO NOT COMMIT REAL SECRETS TO GIT OR DEPLOY PUBLICLY.
#
# PHASE 1 (Default):
# The dashboard runs 100% locally and freely without ANY environment variables.
#
# PHASE 2 (Optional Server-Side Gemini API):
# If you wish to use Google AI Studio's free tier for AI-generated summaries:
# 1. Get a free API key at: https://aistudio.google.com/
# 2. Copy this file to .env
# 3. Add your key below:
#
# NOTE: A consumer Google AI Pro subscription does not provide programmatic API keys.
# Google AI Studio provides free developer keys with rate limits and no credit card.
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_free_ai_studio_key_here
# PORT=3001
#
# GITHUB_TOKEN=optional_github_personal_token_to_lift_rate_limit_to_5000_req_per_hr
